Note:

        For primary coding of fracture of skull and facial bones with associated intracranial
        injury, reference should be made to the morbidity or mortality coding rules and
        guidelines in Volume 2.

        The following subdivisions are provided for optional use in a supplementary character
        position where it is not possible or not desired to use multiple coding to identify
        fracture and open wound; a fracture not indicated as closed or open should be
        classified as closed.
